<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $1 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $1 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 per cwt lower, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 75.50-79.50; 800-900 lbs 57.00-64.00. Medium and Large 2 400-500 lbs few 75.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 63.00-70.50; 700-800 lbs 60.00-65.00. Medium and Large 2 600-700 lbs few 53.00-57.00. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 3,100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
